00:05:17,647 --> 00:05:23,647
The true story of the most beautiful woman in the world

2
00:10:35,294 --> 00:10:41,294
I Am Divine is a documentary film directed by Jeffrey Schwarz.

3
00:15:52,941 --> 00:15:58,941
Harris Glenn Milstead, aka Divine (1945-1988) was the
ultimate outsider turned underground hero.

4
00:21:10,588 --> 00:21:16,588
Spitting in the face of the status quos of body image, gender identity, sexuality, and preconceived notions of beauty, Divine
succeeded in becoming an internationally recognized icon, recording artist, and character actor of stage and screen.

5
00:26:28,235 --> 00:26:34,235
Glenn went from the often-mocked, schoolyard fat kid to underdog royalty, standing up for millions of gay men and
women, drag queens and punk rockers, and countless other socially ostracized misfits and freaks.

6
00:31:45,882 --> 00:31:51,882
With a completely committed in-your-face style, he blurred the line between
performer and personality, and revolutionized pop culture.

7
